    ✗ ./scripts/benchmark/run-adversarial.sh
        对抗实证：真实 LLM 驱动的 Run/Safety/攻击回归。不在此门：要真模型 key，**没有 key 时它会跳过而不报红** —— 这正是 2026-10-31 CTO 周会 §13 记下的那条风险。CI 的 `run-adversarial` job 是 `continue-on-error`（无 key 时同样跳过），故「CI 也没有红」同样**不代表**它跑过。
        Adversarial proof: Run/Safety/attack regression driven by a real LLM. Not here: it needs a real model key, and **without one it skips without failing** — the risk recorded in the 2026-10-31 CTO weekly, §13. The CI `run-adversarial` job is `continue-on-error` (and also skips with no key), so "CI was not red either" does **not** mean it ran.
  
